abstract: "Open-source coupled mechanistic dermal permeation (Dancik et al., 2013) and calibrated middle-out whole-body human PBPK model (Berezhkovskiy tissue partitioning, linear first-order BuChE clearance) for the rivastigmine transdermal patch (5, 10, 15, and 20 cm²) in Open Systems Pharmacology Suite v12.3 (PK-Sim and MoBi)."
